direction: right
configured: Existing configured CRT entry
entry: Shared private C test entry
body: Original void-argument assertion body
status: Actual exit status
configured -> entry -> body -> status
source: Exact source / runtime identities
native: Original controls and dispatch/return control
sysml: SysML source duties
ascent: ASCENT five gates
source -> ascent
native -> ascent
sysml -> ascent
remote: Real Windows compile/link/run
ascent -> remote: publish qualified repair
